      "title": "PYBOX",
      "description": "Python code to simulate the dispersals of a gravity-driven pyroclastic density current (PDC) using a box model physical description. It produces a 2D invasion area adopting the energy conoid approach and using a Digital Surface Model (DSM) as topography. Note: the script supports multiple particle classes.",
